{"sha": "422af450b9c4e43e79ceb95d3e17571f275918157dbe28ea96efddc31192d8ae", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:comparison} 章 --- 函数的比较}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:1}", "$\\sqrt{x^2 + x + 1} = x\\sqrt{1 + \\tfrac1x + \\tfrac{1}{x^2}} = x +", "\\frac12 + \\frac38\\cdot\\frac1x + o\\bigl(\\frac1x\\bigr)$（二项式", "展开：$\\frac12 u - \\frac18 u^2$，其中 $u = \\frac1x +", "\\frac{1}{x^2}$ 得 $\\frac{1}{2x} + \\frac{1}{2x^2} -", "\\frac{1}{8x^2} = \\frac{1}{2x} + \\frac{3}{8x^2}$，再乘以", "$x$）。", "", "$\\ln(x^2 + x) - 2\\ln x = \\ln\\bigl(1 + \\tfrac1x\\bigr) = \\frac1x -", "\\frac{1}{2x^2} + o\\bigl(\\frac{1}{x^2}\\bigr)$。", "", "第三个函数：将各因子展开，", "\\[", "\\frac{x + \\sin x}{x - \\ln x}", "= \\Bigl(1 + \\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\Bigr)", "\\Bigl(1 + \\frac{\\ln x}{x} + \\frac{(\\ln x)^2}{x^2} +", "O\\Bigl(\\frac{(\\ln x)^3}{x^3}\\Bigr)\\Bigr).", "\\]", "在 $+\\infty$ 的比较尺度上将各项排序：$\\frac{\\ln x}{x}", "\\gg \\frac{1}{x} \\geq \\bigl|\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\bigr| \\gg \\frac{(\\ln", "x)^2}{x^2}$。于是前导 $1$ 之后的两项为", "$\\frac{\\ln x}{x}$，随后是有界振荡项 $\\frac{\\sin", "x}{x}$：", "\\[", "\\frac{x + \\sin x}{x - \\ln x}", "= 1 + \\frac{\\ln x}{x} + \\frac{\\sin x}{x}", "+ O\\Bigl(\\frac{(\\ln x)^2}{x^2}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:2}", "$f(t) = t^\\alpha$（$t \\geq 1$）。", "", "$\\alpha > -1$：发散，并由", "\\cref{thm:b2:comparison:seriesintegral}~(2)，可得 $\\sum_{k\\leq n}", "k^\\alpha = \\frac{n^{\\alpha+1}}{\\alpha+1} + C + o(1)$，当 $\\alpha <", "0$ 时（此时 $f$ 递减）；对于 $\\alpha \\geq 0$（$f$ 递增）时，", "用相反的不等号作同样的夹逼，得 $\\sum_{k \\leq n}", "k^\\alpha \\sim \\frac{n^{\\alpha + 1}}{\\alpha + 1}$。", "", "$\\alpha = -1$：$H_n = \\ln n + \\gamma + o(1)$", "（见\\cref{ex:b2:comparison:harmonic}）。", "", "$\\alpha < -1$：收敛，余项为 $\\sum_{k > n} k^\\alpha", "\\sim \\frac{n^{\\alpha+1}}{-(\\alpha+1)}$，由（1）中的夹逼得（两个", "积分界都等价于该值）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:3}", "设 $v_n = H_n - \\ln n - \\gamma \\to 0$。则", "\\[", "v_n - v_{n+1} = \\ln\\frac{n+1}{n} - \\frac{1}{n+1}", "= \\Bigl(\\frac1n - \\frac{1}{2n^2}\\Bigr) - \\Bigl(\\frac1n -", "\\frac{1}{n^2}\\Bigr) + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^3}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{1}{2n^2} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^3}\\Bigr),", "\\]", "利用 $\\frac{1}{n+1} = \\frac1n - \\frac{1}{n^2} + O(n^{-3})$。因", "$v_n \\to 0$，对尾部作裂项求和：", "\\[", "v_n = \\sum_{k \\geq n} (v_k - v_{k+1})", "= \\sum_{k\\geq n} \\Bigl(\\frac{1}{2k^2} + O(k^{-3})\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{1}{2n} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^2}\\Bigr),", "\\]", "由\\cref{thm:b2:comparison:seriesintegral}~(1)，用于 $t^{-2}$", "（余项 $\\sim \\frac1n$，减半）及 $t^{-3}$。因此 $H_n =", "\\ln n + \\gamma + \\frac{1}{2n} + o(\\frac1n)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:4}", "三次应用斯特林公式：", "\\[", "\\frac{(3n)!}{(n!)^3}", "\\sim \\frac{\\sqrt{6\\pi n}\\,(3n/\\eu)^{3n}}", "{(2\\pi n)^{3/2}\\,(n/\\eu)^{3n}}", "= \\frac{\\sqrt{6}\\; 27^{\\,n}}{2\\pi n} \\cdot", "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi n}}\\cdot\\sqrt{2\\pi n}\\;", "= \\frac{\\sqrt3\\,27^n}{2\\pi n} .", "\\]", "（注意：$\\frac{\\sqrt{6\\pi n}}{(2\\pi n)^{3/2}} =", "\\frac{\\sqrt6}{(2\\pi n)\\sqrt{2\\pi n}}\\sqrt{\\pi n} =", "\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2\\pi n}$）。", "", "$\\dfrac{n!}{n^n} \\sim \\sqrt{2\\pi n}\\,\\eu^{-n}$。", "", "$\\sqrt[n]{n!} = \\exp\\bigl(\\frac{\\ln n!}{n}\\bigr)$，其中 $\\ln n! = n\\ln", "n - n + \\frac12\\ln(2\\pi n) + o(1)$：", "\\[", "\\sqrt[n]{n!} = \\exp\\Bigl(\\ln n - 1 + \\frac{\\ln(2\\pi n)}{2n} +", "o\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ln n}{n}\\Bigr)\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{n}{\\eu}\\Bigl(1 + \\frac{\\ln(2\\pi n)}{2n} +", "o\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ln n}{n}\\Bigr)\\Bigr).", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:5}", "$g(x) = x^n + x - 1$ 在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上严格递增，从 $-1$", "增至 $1$：唯一根为 $x_n$。因 $x_n^n = 1 - x_n \\in", "\\intoo{0}{1}$：若沿某子列 $x_n \\leq c < 1$，则 $x_n^n", "\\leq c^n \\to 0$，于是 $1 - x_n \\to 0$，与 $x_n \\leq", "c$ 矛盾。因此 $x_n \\to 1$。", "", "记 $x_n = 1 - \\varepsilon_n$，$\\varepsilon_n \\to 0^+$。方程为", "$(1 - \\varepsilon_n)^n = \\varepsilon_n$，即", "\\[", "n\\ln(1 - \\varepsilon_n) = \\ln \\varepsilon_n", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "-n\\varepsilon_n\\bigl(1 + o(1)\\bigr) = \\ln\\varepsilon_n .", "\\]", "于是 $n\\varepsilon_n = -\\ln\\varepsilon_n\\,(1 + o(1)) \\to +\\infty$，并", "再取对数，得 $\\ln n + \\ln\\varepsilon_n =", "\\ln(-\\ln\\varepsilon_n) + o(1)$。因 $\\ln(-\\ln \\varepsilon_n) =", "o(\\ln(1/\\varepsilon_n))$，由此得 $\\ln\\varepsilon_n \\sim -\\ln", "n$，从而 $\\varepsilon_n = \\frac{-\\ln\\varepsilon_n}{n}(1 + o(1))", "\\sim \\frac{\\ln n}{n}$：", "\\[", "x_n = 1 - \\frac{\\ln n}{n} + o\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ln n}{n}\\Bigr) .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", ""]}